    {
      "content": "Yeah, so we're time based. So it's for Thursdays it's looking like if we were to have availability it's $95 an hour per mover. So for a two mover team you're looking at $190 an hour and then depending on how far you are typically we don't have any additional, like, travel fees or anything like that. If you're, as long as you're, within fifteen miles of our like, the radius of our home office and then we don't have any additional fees as part, as, like, as far as like padding wrapping all that kind of stuff goes it's literally just the hourly rate and then we prorate the time in fifteen minute increments. So it's super simple. As far as.",
